    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to 70 Bow Bridge Place, a superbly presented 2nd floor apartment ideally positioned in this highly convenient and well-maintained development in the heart of Dublin 8.  Offering bright, spacious accommodation throughout, this impressive two bedroom residence combines comfort, convenience, and city living in one of Dublin’s most sought-after locations. \r\nThe property features a welcoming entrance hallway leading to a bright spacious lounge area filled with natural light, complete with private balcony overlooking beautifully maintained communal gardens, the perfect setting to relax and unwind. The separate kitchen offers ample storage and workspace, while two generous double bedrooms provide excellent accommodation for owner-occupiers and investors alike. \r\nResidents benefit from secure underground car parking together with the convenience of being within walking distance of a host of local amenities including shops, cafes, restaurants, LUAS links, and Dublin city centre. \r\nBow Bridge Place enjoys an enviable location close to the Coombe Hospital, St James Hospital, the Guinness Quarter, and a variety of recreational and cultural amenities, making it an ideal choice for those seeking stylish city living with every convenience on the doorstep."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall:\t with laminate wood floor and hotpress \r\n   \r\nLounge: feature marble fireplace with wooden surround and electric inset fire, laminate wood floor, TV point, sliding patio door to balcony overlooking landscaped grounds  \t\t\t\t\t\r\nc.7.0x3.2m  \r\n  \r\nKitchen: with range of floor and wall mounted fitted press units, tiled splash-back, tiled floor, oven and hob, plumbed for washing machine, integrated spotlights  \t\r\nc.2.4x2.1m\t\t                                   \t\t                        \r\n\r\nBedroom 1: with built in wardrobes \t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nc.4.3x2.7m\t\t\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: with built in wardrobes\t\t \t\t\t\r\nc.4.3x3.5m\r\n\t\t\r\nBathroom: with bath, W.C and W.H.B, partially tiled walls and tiled floor\t\t\t\r\nc.1.9x2.4m"
      },
      {
